1
00:00:00,367 --> 00:00:02,900
Are you a SMART fella,

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,933
or a FART smella?

3
00:00:04,933 --> 00:00:06,433
Let's find OUT!

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:08,200
Alright,

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,000
a word analogy!

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,367
Pen is to write,

7
00:00:12,367 --> 00:00:14,767
as scissors is to...

8
00:00:14,767 --> 00:00:15,367
what?

9
00:00:15,367 --> 00:00:15,967
A.

10
00:00:15,967 --> 00:00:16,567
Paper,

11
00:00:16,567 --> 00:00:17,133
B.

12
00:00:17,133 --> 00:00:17,733
Cut,

13
00:00:17,733 --> 00:00:18,333
C.

14
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:18,933
Sharp,

15
00:00:18,933 --> 00:00:20,133
or D.

16
00:00:20,133 --> 00:00:20,733
Glue?

17
00:00:20,733 --> 00:00:21,933
Five seconds!

18
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:28,900
TIME'S UP!

19
00:00:29,567 --> 00:00:29,967
It's...

20
00:00:29,967 --> 00:00:30,367
B,

21
00:00:30,367 --> 00:00:30,767
cut!

22
00:00:30,767 --> 00:00:33,167
A pen is used to write,

23
00:00:33,167 --> 00:00:35,567
so scissors are used to cut.

24
00:00:35,567 --> 00:00:38,367
It is the job each tool does.

25
00:00:39,533 --> 00:00:40,067
Okay,

26
00:00:40,067 --> 00:00:41,700
a picture puzzle!

27
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:44,933
Where does the dot move next?

28
00:00:44,933 --> 00:00:45,500
A.

29
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,033
Top-left,

30
00:00:46,033 --> 00:00:46,567
B.

31
00:00:46,567 --> 00:00:47,100
Bottom-right,

32
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:47,633
C.

33
00:00:47,633 --> 00:00:48,200
Center,

34
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,267
or D.

35
00:00:49,267 --> 00:00:49,800
Top-right?

36
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:50,900
Five seconds!

37
00:00:56,667 --> 00:00:57,867
TIME'S UP!

38
00:00:58,533 --> 00:01:00,200
The answer is...

39
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:00,767
B,

40
00:01:00,767 --> 00:01:01,333
bottom-right!

41
00:01:01,333 --> 00:01:03,567
The dot steps counter-clockwise

42
00:01:03,567 --> 00:01:05,267
corner to corner:

43
00:01:05,267 --> 00:01:05,800
top-right,

44
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:06,367
top-left,

45
00:01:06,367 --> 00:01:06,933
bottom-left,

46
00:01:06,933 --> 00:01:10,300
so the next corner is bottom-right.

47
00:01:11,433 --> 00:01:12,133
Alright,

48
00:01:12,133 --> 00:01:14,167
a number analogy!

49
00:01:14,167 --> 00:01:16,233
Two makes eight,

50
00:01:16,233 --> 00:01:18,300
three makes twelve,

51
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:20,333
four makes sixteen,

52
00:01:20,333 --> 00:01:22,400
so five makes...

53
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,100
what?

54
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:23,767
A.

55
00:01:23,767 --> 00:01:24,467
Twenty,

56
00:01:24,467 --> 00:01:25,133
B.

57
00:01:25,133 --> 00:01:25,833
Eighteen,

58
00:01:25,833 --> 00:01:26,533
C.

59
00:01:26,533 --> 00:01:27,200
Twenty-four,

60
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,567
or D.

61
00:01:28,567 --> 00:01:29,267
Fifteen?

62
00:01:29,267 --> 00:01:30,633
Five seconds!

63
00:01:36,433 --> 00:01:37,633
TIME'S UP!

64
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:38,867
It's...

65
00:01:38,867 --> 00:01:39,467
A,

66
00:01:39,467 --> 00:01:40,033
twenty!

67
00:01:40,033 --> 00:01:43,500
Each number is multiplied by four:

68
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:46,367
five times four is twenty.

69
00:01:47,533 --> 00:01:47,933
So,

70
00:01:47,933 --> 00:01:49,967
are you smart or fart?

71
00:01:49,967 --> 00:01:52,400
Count up your correct answers to

72
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,600
find your rank!

73
00:01:54,767 --> 00:01:55,100
So,

74
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:56,500
how did you do?

75
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:57,867
Comment your score below,

76
00:01:57,867 --> 00:01:59,233
and follow for more!
